     "summary_en": "The team taught Grade 3 students a synthetic biology and dengue lesson: DNA, genes and cells explained with toy-block analogies for ATCG, dengue videos and Q&A games on symptoms and prevention, and a DIY DNA bracelet activity (Grade 3 students first did a base-pairing worksheet).",
     "summary_zh": "團隊為三年級學生上合成生物學與登革熱課程：以積木比喻ATCG來講解DNA、基因與細胞，搭配登革熱影片與症狀、預防的問答遊戲，並帶學生動手做DNA手環（三年級學生先完成鹼基配對學習單）。",
     "impact_en": "Surveys across the four elementary schools: 95% of students clearly understood dengue symptoms, effects and prevention after the lesson (only 7% knew the details before), and 89% said they understood DNA and biology better. The team adjusted its lesson plan between schools.",
     "impact_zh": "四所國小的課後問卷顯示，95%的學生清楚了解登革熱的症狀、影響與預防（課前僅7%了解細節），89%的學生表示對DNA與生物學更了解。團隊也在各校之間持續調整教案。",
