     "summary_en": "The team taught Grade 10–12 students synthetic biology and dengue: a blueberry DNA extraction experiment, CRISPR, BioBricks, PCR, gel electrophoresis and cloning, GM foods and their ethics, dengue and the team's beetroot-geosmin ovitrap with Cyt2Ba, and an introduction to iGEM. The lesson was made harder based on the Yonghe Junior High experience.",
     "summary_zh": "團隊為高一至高三學生講授合成生物學與登革熱：藍莓DNA萃取實驗、CRISPR、BioBrick、PCR、膠體電泳與基因選殖、基改食品及其倫理議題、登革熱與團隊結合甜菜根土臭素與Cyt2Ba的誘卵器，並介紹iGEM。 團隊根據在永和國中的經驗調高了課程難度。",
     "impact_en": "90% of the junior high and high school students reported a positive impact. Many who were wary of GMOs became curious, and some said they were interested in careers in synthetic biology.",
     "impact_zh": "90%的國高中學生表示課程對自己有正面影響；許多原本對基改抱持疑慮的學生轉而感到好奇，也有學生表示有興趣投入合成生物學相關職涯。",
